<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST641"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Laoise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Laoise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, July 28, 2004 - 6:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->No big surprise to people that I do feel theres a huge connection to Zodiac in this case although I don’t feel he &#40;BTK&#41; is in awe of Zodiac. I think he views Z as a kindred spirit in the truest sense… because of this, I think August is VERY important to BTK. IF he&#39;s gonna kill again, its gonna be in August no doubts. July 31st, 1969 Z wrote 3 letters to the newspapers demanding that his ciphers be published on the front page the next day…. August 1st. There were 2 murders in August ’69 that Z claimed but they weren’t his. &#40;hmmmm…..&#41; Also, one the leading contenders for being Z, Arthur Lee Allen, died August 26, 1992. Now, if he does indeed feel he is kindred to Z and he believes that Allen was Z, then that would be a critical month for him… the final curtain… a return to the stage. but he wont be done.  <BR>he&#39;ll be quiet again in september.... coming down from the kill.... hence dusk  <BR>october will be another letter… will there more is the chapter title  <BR>november- A serial killer ???- another murder planned?  <BR>december-dawn- no clue  <BR>january- fetish- another communique dealing exclusively with the sadomasochism that attracts him?  <BR>february- fantasy world- explaining the process for him  <BR>march- the search begins- he gets quiet and has given the cops EVERYTHING they need to bust him  <BR>He’ll probably leave town then as well.  <BR> <BR>Gods I hope im not giving him ideas here!!! lol  <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 641-->
<!--Post: 646--><!--Time: 1091094508-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST646"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:zodiacfiles@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Ed_neil<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ed_neil<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 29, 2004 - 2:48 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Laoise: what you&#39;ve said is very possible, but I suspect that BTK won&#39;t be leaving town anytime soon.  I don&#39;t think he left after Vicki Wegerle and returned at a later date.  I would bet dollars to donuts that BTK has lived in Wichita for many years, and plans to continue to live there right under the noses of WPD, in much the same way that I&#39;ve suspected that his hero, the Zodiac Killer, is still alive and well and living in Vallejo, right where his crimes started and right under the noses of VPD.  He ain&#39;t going anywhere.  It&#39;s his game right now, and only he knows the rules.  And he&#39;s not about to play his hand.  All we can do is wait and see what his next move is.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 646-->
<!--Post: 652--><!--Time: 1091196301-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST652"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Matt<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Matt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, July 30, 2004 - 7:05 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Actually, the guy that Tom Voight pretty much proved to be Zodiac did die in Vallejo from diabetes, still living in his parent&#39;s home.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 652-->
<!--Post: 657--><!--Time: 1091300842-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST657"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, July 31, 2004 - 12:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->ALA? I assume thats who you mean. Ed&#39;s right, It&#39;s his move now<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 657-->
<!--Post: 963--><!--Time: 1094132624-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST963"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, September 02, 2004 - 6:43 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Next month, October, there will be a nationwide convention of psychologists in Wichita. Maybe they will bring out the best in BTK. Will he react or act? I guess we have to wait and see.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
